  "notes": "USAGE:\nSpecifically refers to shooting with firearms or projectile weapons. Written with {撃|う}つ to distinguish from the more general ⟦{打|う}つ→打つ：01221_utsu⟧ (to hit, to strike). Both are read うつ but have different meanings and kanji.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{銃|じゅう}→銃：10463_juu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{撃|う}つ: to fire a gun\n- ⟦{弾|たま}→弾：28121_tama⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{撃|う}つ: to fire a bullet\n- {撃|う}ち{落|お}とす: to shoot down\n- {撃|う}ち{殺|ころ}す: to shoot dead\n- {撃|う}ち{抜|ぬ}く: to shoot through\n\nWRITING:\n{撃|う}つ specifically uses the kanji {撃|げき} (attack, strike), distinguishing it from ⟦{打|う}つ→打つ：01221_utsu⟧ (to hit/strike with hands or tools).",
